  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Thinly slice leek. Roughly chop baby spinach leaves.<br>• In a large frying pan, heat the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium\u0002high heat. Cook leek, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes. <br>• SPICY! This spice blend is hot! Add less if you’re sensitive to heat. Stir in <br>tomato paste and Mexican Fiesta spice blend (reserving a pinch for the<br>corn) and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957fcd9848b9dac0594cd/step-97570300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, place corn cobs on a lined oven tray. <br>• Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt, sprinkle with a pinch of the reserved <br>Mexican Fiesta spice blend and toss to coat. <br>• Roast until tender and slightly charred, 15-20 minutes.<br>TIP: Cut the corn cobs in half before cooking for easier eating. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957fcd9848b9dac0594cd/step-79f53010.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To pan with leek, add basmati rice, the water and stock concentrate <br>(see ingredients), stir, then bring to the boil. <br>• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. <br>• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from the heat and keep covered until the <br>rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes. <br>TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don’t peek! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957fcd9848b9dac0594cd/step-30fb7520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the pan with rice, stir in chopped spinach until combined. <br>• Divide Mexican rice between bowls. Serve with corn cobs. <br>• Drizzle smokey aioli and crumble fetta cubes over corn. <br>• Tear over coriander to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957fcd9848b9dac0594cd/step-d3eb6430.jpg"
    }
  ]
